[{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Show that</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-4\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2k+1&amp;-4k\\\\k&amp;1-2k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2(k+1)+1&amp;-4(k+1)\\\\k+1&amp;1-2(k+1)\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2^k-1\\\\0&amp;2^k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2^{k+1}-1\\\\0&amp;2^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-\\frac14(5^k-1)&amp;5^k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-\\frac14(5^{k+1}-1)&amp;5^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-4\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2k+1&amp;-4k\\\\k&amp;1-2k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}6k+3-4k&amp;-12k-4+8k\\\\2k+1-k&amp;-4k-1+2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2k+3&amp;-4k-4\\\\k+1&amp;-2k-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2(k+1)+1&amp;-4(k+1)\\\\k+1&amp;-2(k+1)+1\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ as required.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2^k-1\\\\0&amp;2^k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2^k-1+2^k\\\\0&amp;2\\times2^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2^{k+1}-1\\\\0&amp;2^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ as required.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-\\frac14(5^k-1)&amp;5^k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1-\\frac54(5^k-1)&amp;5\\times5^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1-\\frac54\\times5^k+\\frac54&amp;5^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-\\frac14+\\frac14 5^k&amp;5^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-\\frac14(5^{k+1}-1)&amp;5^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ as required.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Prove by induction, for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;n\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2n\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\times1\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2k\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2k\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2+2k\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2(k+1)\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2n\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-2\\\\2&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\begin{pmatrix}2n+1&amp;-2n\\\\2n&amp;1-2n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}2+1&amp;-2\\\\2&amp;1-2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-2\\\\2&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2k+1&amp;-2k\\\\2k&amp;1-2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-2\\\\2&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2k+1&amp;-2k\\\\2k&amp;1-2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}6k+3-4k&amp;-6k-2+4k\\\\4k+2-2k&amp;-4k-1+2k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2k-2&amp;-2k-2\\\\2k+2&amp;-2k-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2(k+1)+1&amp;-2(k+1)\\\\2(k+1)&amp;1-2(k+1)\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2n+1&amp;-2n\\\\2n&amp;1-2n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2i\\\\2i&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\begin{pmatrix}2n+1&amp;2ni\\\\2ni&amp;1-2n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}2+1&amp;2i\\\\2i&amp;1-2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2i\\\\2i&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2k+1&amp;2ki\\\\2ki&amp;1-2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2i\\\\2i&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2k+1&amp;2ki\\\\2ki&amp;1-2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}6k+3-4k&amp;6ki+2i-4ki\\\\4ki+2i-2ki&amp;-4k-1+2k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2k+3&amp;2ki+2i\\\\2ki+2i&amp;-1-2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2(k+1)+1&amp;2(k+1)i\\\\2(k+1)i&amp;1-2(k+1)\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2n+1&amp;2ni\\\\2ni&amp;1-2n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\begin{pmatrix}2^n&amp;4^n-2^n\\\\0&amp;4^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}2^1&amp;4^1-2^1\\\\0&amp;4^1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2^k&amp;4^k-2^k\\\\0&amp;4^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2\\\\0&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2^k&amp;4^k-2^k\\\\0&amp;4^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\times2^k&amp;2\\times4^k-2\\times2^k+2\\times4^k\\\\0&amp;4\\times4^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2^1\\times2^k&amp;4^1\\times4^k-2^1\\times2^k\\\\0&amp;4^1\\times4^k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2^{k+1}&amp;4^{k+1}-2^{k+1}\\\\0&amp;4^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2^n&amp;4^n-2^n\\\\0&amp;4^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}2^n&amp;n2^{n-1}\\\\0&amp;2^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}2^1&amp;1\\times2^{1-1}\\\\0&amp;2^1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2^k&amp;k\\times2^{k-1}\\\\0&amp;2^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2^k&amp;k\\times2^{k-1}\\\\0&amp;2^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\times2^k&amp;2k\\times2^{k-1}+2^k\\\\0&amp;2\\times2^k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2^1\\times2^k&amp;k\\times2^k+2^k\\\\0&amp;2^1\\times2^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2^{k+1}&amp;(k+1)\\times2^k\\\\0&amp;2^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2^{k+1}&amp;(k+1)\\times2^{(k+1)-1}\\\\0&amp;2^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2^n&amp;n2^{n-1}\\\\0&amp;2^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3^n-1)\\\\0&amp;3^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3^1-1)\\\\0&amp;3^1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3^k-1)\\\\0&amp;3^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3^k-1)\\\\0&amp;3^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3^k-1)+3^k\\\\0&amp;3\\times3^k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3^k-1+2\\times3^k)\\\\0&amp;3^1\\times3^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3\\times3^k-1)\\\\0&amp;3^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3^{k+1}-1)\\\\0&amp;3^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;\\frac12(3^n-1)\\\\0&amp;3^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\1-4^n&amp;4^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\\\frac13(1-4^1)&amp;4^1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\\\frac13(1-4^k)&amp;4^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\\\frac13(1-4^k)&amp;4^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1+\\frac43(1-4^k)&amp;4\\times4^k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\-1+\\frac43-\\frac13\\times4\\times4^k&amp;4^1\\times4^k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\\\frac13-\\frac13\\times4^1\\times4^k&amp;4^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\\\frac13(1-4^{k+1})&amp;4^{k+1}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\\\frac13(1-4^n)&amp;4^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Write down a suitable form for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive integer.</p></li><li><p>Prove your answer to part b).</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;6\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^3=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;6\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;9\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^4=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;9\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;12\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3n\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\times1\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3k\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3k\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3k+3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3(k+1)\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3n\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;a\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is real, prove <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}4^n&amp;\\frac a3(4^n-1)\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is true for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}4^1&amp;\\frac a3(4^1-1)\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;a\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}4^k&amp;\\frac a3(4^k-1)\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;a\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4^k&amp;\\frac a3(4^k-1)\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}4\\times4^k&amp;\\frac43a(4^k-1)+a\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4^1\\times4^k&amp;\\frac43a\\times4^k-\\frac43a+a\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}4^{k+1}&amp;\\frac a3\\times4\\times4^k-\\frac a3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4^{k+1}&amp;\\frac a3(4^{k+1}-1)\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4^n&amp;\\frac a3(4^n-1)\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-9\\\\1&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Prove that for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}1-3n&amp;-9n\\\\n&amp;3n+1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find the line of invariant points of the transformation represented by matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Show, algebraically, that the transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has the same line of invariant points.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}1-3&amp;-9\\\\1&amp;3+1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-9\\\\1&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1-3k&amp;-9k\\\\k&amp;3k+1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-9\\\\1&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1-3k&amp;-9k\\\\k&amp;3k+1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}-2+6k-9k&amp;18k-27k-9\\\\1-3k+4k&amp;-9k+12k+4\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2-3k&amp;-9k-9\\\\1+k&amp;3k+4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1-3(k+1)&amp;-9(k+1)\\\\k+1&amp;3(k+1)+1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1-3n&amp;-9n\\\\n&amp;3n+1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-9\\\\1&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-2x-9y=x\\Rightarrow-9y=3x\\Rightarrow y=-\\frac13x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x+4y=y\\Rightarrow3y=-x\\Rightarrow y=-\\frac13x.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So any point on the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac13x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is invariant.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1-3n&amp;-9n\\\\n&amp;3n+1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1-3n)x-9ny=x\\Rightarrow-9ny=3nx\\Rightarrow y=-\\frac13x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"nx+3ny+y=y\\Rightarrow3ny=-nx\\Rightarrow y=-\\frac13x.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So any point on the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac13x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is invariant.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>It is known that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-a\\\\a&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is imaginary and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\det A=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A^n=4^{n-1}A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det A=4+a^2=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\pm2i\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-2i\\\\2i&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2i\\\\-2i&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=4^{1-1}A=4^0A=A\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=4^{k-1}A.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-2i\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-2i\\\\2i&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\times4^{k-1}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-2i\\\\2i&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=4^{k-1}\\begin{pmatrix}4+4&amp;-4i-4i\\\\4i+4i&amp;4+4\\end{pmatrix}=4^{k-1}\\begin{pmatrix}8&amp;-8i\\\\8i&amp;8\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=4\\times4^{k-1}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-2i\\\\2i&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}=4^1\\times4^{k-1}A=4^kA\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^{n-1}A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2i\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2i\\\\-2i&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\times4^{k-1}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2i\\\\-2i&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=4^{k-1}\\begin{pmatrix}4+4&amp;4i+4i\\\\-4i-4i&amp;4+4\\end{pmatrix}=4^{k-1}\\begin{pmatrix}8&amp;8i\\\\-8i&amp;8\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=4\\times4^{k-1}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2i\\\\-2i&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}=4^1\\times4^{k-1}A=4^kA\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4^{n-1}A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Two square matrices, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, are such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"AB=B^4A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B^5=I\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Prove that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B^nAB^n=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"B^1AB^1=B(AB)=B(B^4A)=B^5A=IA=A\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"B^kAB^k=A.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"B^{k+1}AB^{k+1}=BB^kAB^kB\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=B(B^kAB^k)B\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=BAB\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=B(B^4A)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=B^5A\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=IA\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=A.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.46-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Prove by mathematical induction, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;n&amp;\\frac12n(n+1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;n\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2n&amp;\\frac12n(n+3)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;n\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\begin{pmatrix}2^n&amp;1-2^n&amp;3(2^n-1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;\\frac12(1+1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k&amp;\\frac12k(k+1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k&amp;\\frac12k(k+1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1&amp;\\frac12k(k+1)+k+1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k+1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1&amp;\\frac12(k(k+1)+2k+2)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k+1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1&amp;\\frac12(k+1)(k+2)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;n\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;n&amp;\\frac12n(n+1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;n\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;\\frac12(1+3)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;2\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k&amp;\\frac12k(k+3)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;2\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k&amp;\\frac12k(k+3)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1&amp;\\frac12k(k+3)+k+2\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k+1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1&amp;\\frac12(k(k+3)+2k+4)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k+1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1&amp;\\frac12(k^2+3k+2k+4)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k+1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1&amp;\\frac12(k^2+5k+4)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k+1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;k+1&amp;\\frac12(k+1)(k+4)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;k+1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;n&amp;\\frac12n(n+3)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;n\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^1=\\begin{pmatrix}2^1&amp;1-2^1&amp;3(2^1-1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2^k&amp;1-2^k&amp;3(2^k-1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A^{k+1}=A^1\\times A^k=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2^k&amp;1-2^k&amp;3(2^k-1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\times2^k&amp;2(1-2^k)-1&amp;6(2^k-1)+3\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2^1\\times2^k&amp;2-2\\times2^k-1&amp;3(2\\times2^k-2)+3\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2^{k+1}&amp;1-2^1\\times2^k&amp;3(2^1\\times2^k-2+1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}2^{k+1}&amp;1-2^{k+1}&amp;3(2^{k+1}-1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2^n&amp;1-2^n&amp;3(2^n-1)\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]